1
00:01:52,512 --> 00:01:57,590
<v Man> Oh, excuse me, I wonder if you’d have the time to take part in some market research?

2
00:01:57,590 --> 00:02:00,374
<v Woman> Umm ... What’s it about?

3
00:02:00,374 --> 00:02:07,538
<v Man> About this club and your experiences and opinions about being a member. It’ll take less than five minutes.

4
00:02:07,538 --> 00:02:11,167
<v Woman> Oh ... OK then ... as long as it’s quick.

5
00:02:11,167 --> 00:02:14,034
<v Man> Can I start by taking your name?

6
00:02:14,034 --> 00:02:16,630
<v Woman> It’s Selina Thompson.

7
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:21,595
<v Man> Is that T-H-O-M-P-S-O-N?

8
00:02:21,595 --> 00:02:22,285
<v Woman> Yes.

9
00:02:22,285 --> 00:02:27,760
<v Man> Great, thanks ... And what do you do for a living?

10
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:32,619
<v Woman> Well, I’m an accountant but I’m between jobs at the moment.

11
00:02:32,619 --> 00:02:46,341
<v Man> I understand, but that’s the job I’ll put down on the form. And would you mind my asking which age group you fall into? Below thirty, thirty-one to fifty and above.

12
00:02:46,341 --> 00:02:50,398
<v Woman> Over fifty ... I think we can safely say.

13
00:02:51,334 --> 00:02:55,452
<v Man> Great, thanks. And which type of membership do you have?

14
00:02:55,452 --> 00:02:59,752
<v Woman> Sorry, I’m not sure what you mean? Do you mean how long ... ?

15
00:02:59,752 --> 00:03:02,530
<v Man> No, is it a single person membership ... ?

16
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:05,221
<v Woman> Oh right ... no, it’s a family membership.

17
00:03:05,221 --> 00:03:09,314
<v Man> Thanks and how long have you been a member?

18
00:03:09,314 --> 00:03:19,163
<v Woman> Oh ... let me see ... I was certainly here five years ago ... and it was probably two to three years more than that ...

19
00:03:19,163 --> 00:03:21,076
<v Man> Shall I put down eight?

20
00:03:21,076 --> 00:03:24,726
<v Woman> I remember now ... it’s nine ... definitely ... sorry.

21
00:03:24,726 --> 00:03:32,335
<v Man> No problem ... I’ve got that. And the last question in this first part is, what brought you to the club?

22
00:03:32,335 --> 00:03:33,235
<v Woman> Sorry ... ?

23
00:03:33,235 --> 00:03:37,555
<v Man> How did you find out about the club? Did you see any ads?

24
00:03:37,555 --> 00:03:45,804
<v Woman> Well, I did actually but I have to say I wasn’t really attracted to the club because of that. It was through word of mouth.

25
00:03:45,804 --> 00:03:48,444
<v Man> So you were recommended by a friend?

26
00:03:48,444 --> 00:03:58,835
<v Woman> Actually my doctor ... I’d been suffering from high blood pressure and he said the club was very supportive of people with that condition, so I signed up.

27
00:03:58,835 --> 00:04:00,529
<v Man> Great ... thanks.

28
00:04:32,547 --> 00:04:37,796
<v Man> Now for the second part of the form I want to ask a bit more about your experience of the club.

29
00:04:37,796 --> 00:04:38,496
<v Woman> Sure.

30
00:04:38,496 --> 00:04:41,407
<v Man> How often would you say you use the club ... ?

31
00:04:42,557 --> 00:04:46,075
<v Woman> It varies enormously depending on how busy I am.

32
00:04:46,075 --> 00:04:49,778
<v Man> Of course ... but on average ... per month?

33
00:04:49,778 --> 00:04:53,781
<v Woman> I’d say it averages out at twice a week.

34
00:04:53,781 --> 00:04:56,840
<v Man> OK, so eight on average.

35
00:04:56,840 --> 00:05:00,912
<v Woman> Yeah. And four of those are aqua-aerobics classes.

36
00:05:00,912 --> 00:05:07,742
<v Man> That leads me to the next question ... would you say the swimming pool is the facility you make most use of?

37
00:05:07,742 --> 00:05:09,967
<v Woman> Fair to say that ... yeah.

38
00:05:09,967 --> 00:05:14,923
<v Man> Right, thanks ... And are there any facilities you don’t use?

39
00:05:14,923 --> 00:05:24,296
<v Woman> One area I realise I’ve never used is the tennis courts ... and there’s one simple reason for that ...

40
00:05:24,296 --> 00:05:25,662
<v Man> You don’t play tennis?

41
00:05:25,662 --> 00:05:32,785
<v Woman> Actually, I’m not bad at it ... it’s that I’m not happy having to pay extra ... for that privilege.

42
00:05:32,785 --> 00:05:44,566
<v Man> I’ve made a note of that ... thanks. Now in the last section are there any suggestions or recommendations you have for improvements to the club?

43
00:05:44,566 --> 00:05:47,117
<v Woman> Only about health and fitness?

44
00:05:47,117 --> 00:05:48,525
<v Man> Anything at all ...

45
00:05:48,525 --> 00:05:59,321
<v Woman> Well, I’d like to see more social events ... it isn’t just a question of getting together for games or classes but other things, you know.

46
00:05:59,321 --> 00:06:00,221
<v Man> Yes, sure.

47
00:06:00,221 --> 00:06:11,449
<v Woman> And another thing that I was thinking when I had my yoga class in the gym last night - we were all sweltering in the heat - was that I think they should put in ... you know ...

48
00:06:11,449 --> 00:06:12,863
<v Man> Air conditioning.

49
00:06:12,863 --> 00:06:20,711
<v Woman> That’s exactly what I mean. The rooms are really light and well designed but they do need proper installations.

50
00:06:20,711 --> 00:06:23,539
<v Man> Sure ... well I’ve made a note of that ...

51
00:06:23,539 --> 00:06:24,281
<v Woman> Good.

52
00:06:24,281 --> 00:06:30,433
<v Man> ... so is there anything else you’d like to suggest ... about quality of service, for example?

53
00:06:30,433 --> 00:06:44,636
<v Woman> Oh, everyone’s very nice here ... they couldn’t be more friendly and helpful ... oh but I tell you what ... it’s a shame the restaurant isn’t open in the evening on Saturday ... and Sunday as well for that matter.

54
00:06:44,636 --> 00:06:47,350
<v Man> So ... the club should ...

55
00:06:47,350 --> 00:06:49,573
<v Woman> ... open it later on those days.

56
00:06:49,573 --> 00:06:53,967
<v Man> OK . well thank you very much, that’s all the questions .